h4. Upload limits

Your upload limit is how many posts you can have pending at once. It goes up as your uploads are approved and down as they are deleted.

* Each pending post takes one slot. An appealed post takes three. A post deleted within three days of upload takes five.
* Slots are freed when a post is approved or deleted.
* You start with 15 slots. The limit can range from 5 to 40.
* Approvals earn slots; every three deletions cost one.

Your current limit and how it was arrived at are shown on your user page. Contributor and above are not held for approval, so their uploads do not occupy slots. See [[help:mod_queue]].
